WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.584 --> 00:00:01.418
What's your name?

00:00:01.502 --> 00:00:02.878
-Sachini.
-Where you from?

00:00:03.545 --> 00:00:04.463
Austin.

00:00:04.546 --> 00:00:06.215
Austin, okay, but where
are you really from?

00:00:06.924 --> 00:00:08.300
Just outside of Austin.

00:00:08.383 --> 00:00:11.011
Give it up for Chardonnay, everybody.
All right? She's fun.

00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:17.976
♪ Almost heaven, West Virginia ♪

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.812
♪ Blue Ridge Mountains ♪

00:00:20.896 --> 00:00:23.565
It's not a gamble
if I know it's gonna work.

00:00:23.649 --> 00:00:26.985
Sometimes you think too much
like an American dreamer.

00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:33.200
♪ Country roads, take me home ♪

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:38.872
♪ To the place I belong ♪

00:00:38.956 --> 00:00:41.291
Your being a success
is everything to me.

00:00:42.793 --> 00:00:45.629
Oh jeez, Sach, what's wrong with you?

00:00:45.712 --> 00:00:48.173
My parents are here, and they think
I'm at college in Houston.

00:00:48.799 --> 00:00:49.967
They don't know you dropped out?

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:55.180
In this country,
everything has strings.

00:00:55.264 --> 00:00:56.139
Don't forget that.

00:00:58.433 --> 00:01:00.143
You never know where you're gonna end up.

00:01:00.227 --> 00:01:01.937
Only you know what you want.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.857
-What do you have that thing set to?
-80 miles per hour.

00:01:04.940 --> 00:01:07.484
-Maybe we should set it to like 40 or--
-Don't touch it!

00:01:09.736 --> 00:01:14.449
I thought baseball players drank beer
and ate sunflower seeds.

00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:16.285
When does it get fun?

00:01:16.368 --> 00:01:19.997
♪ Drivin' down the road, I get a feelin' ♪

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:24.168
♪ That I should've been home yesterday ♪

00:01:24.251 --> 00:01:25.460
Shame does you no good.

00:01:25.544 --> 00:01:28.005
You deserve to feel amazing.

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:33.844
♪ To the place I belong ♪

00:01:34.678 --> 00:01:36.013
You don't want the arm?

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:43.061
You could never be who you were
supposed to be back home.

00:01:44.062 --> 00:01:46.648
That is why you have been delivered here.
So do what you came to do.

00:01:48.025 --> 00:01:53.864
♪ Take me home, country roads ♪

00:01:54.698 --> 00:01:56.200
This is our life now.

00:01:56.283 --> 00:01:59.870
And I promise you, it's going to be good.

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:05.792
♪ Take me home, country roads ♪

